{'symbol': 'LUMN', 'date': '2021-12-01 07:12:00', 'title': 'LUMEN EDGE GATEWAY EXTENDS THE LUMEN PLATFORM TO DELIVER IT APPLICATIONS AND VIRTUALIZED SERVICES ON THE EDGE', 'text': "DENVER, DEC. 1, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0TODAY'S BUSINESSES REQUIRE FAST PROVISIONING OF SERVICES ACROSS DISTRIBUTED COMPUTING ARCHITECTURE TO KEEP UP WITH THE PACE OF CHANGE. LUMEN TECHNOLOGIES (NYSE: LUMN) HAS INTRODUCED LUMEN EDGE GATEWAY TO EMPOWER ENTERPRISES TO DEPLOY A RANGE OF VIRTUALIZED SERVICES IN HOURS, WITHOUT HAVING TO CONTINUALLY REPLACE ONSITE EQUIPMENT."}